---
<PolicyLayout title="Research policy" lede="How work on this site is labelled, checked and corrected.">
  <ul>
    <li>Projects show their real status: idea, in progress, completed or archived.</li>
    <li>Findings are stated only where the analysis has been done. Planned work is labelled as planned.</li>
    <li>Limitations and uncertainties are listed on every project.</li>
    <li>Sources are cited, with access dates for data.</li>
    <li>Corrections are recorded in the <a href="/research/changelog/">changelog</a>.</li>
    <li>This site does not claim to be a research group, institute or formal academic body.</li>
  </ul>
</PolicyLayout>
